Exercise native shared-texture initialization before the first GPU submission.
The peer writes through the exported mapping, as Neptune does; both alpha-only
and RGBA textures must preserve those writes, with and without initial data.

--- a/tests/native/d3d11_test.cpp
+++ b/tests/native/d3d11_test.cpp
@@ -30,14 +30,9 @@
 
